UID:10012195-1785920400-1785927600@njaudubon.org
SUMMARY:Fishing Basics
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fun-filled day of fishing basics! Whether you’re a beginner or just want to brush up on your skills\, this in-person event is perfect for you. Our experienced instructors will cover everything from casting techniques to knot tying. You’ll also learn about bait selection and fish identification. This is a great opportunity to meet fellow fishing enthusiasts and enjoy the great outdoors. So\, grab your friends and family and get ready for a day of reeling in some unforgettable memories! \nIn partnership with Franklin Lakes Healthy Living. \nCOST:  \n\nChild (NJ Audubon Member): $10\nChild (Non-member): $10\nAdult (NJ Audubon Member) – Participating: $12\nAdult (Non-member) – Participating: $12\nChaperone (non-participating adult): FREE\n\nIMPORTANT INFORMATION: \n\nParticipants are welcome to bring their own equipment\, loaner rods\, tackle\, and bait will be available to share.\nThis event is not a drop off program\, all participants under 16 must be accompanied by a ticketed adult.\nThis program takes place entirely outdoors and will take place in light rain. Please dress appropriately for the weather conditions. \n\nCANCELLATION: NJ Audubon’s programs require a minimum number of registrants to run. If we cancel\, due to lack of participation\, severe weather\, or unforeseen circumstances\, all participants will be notified as soon as possible and are eligible for a full refund. Participants may cancel without penalty if greater than 48 hours in advance. Sorry\, no refund for cancellations less than 48 hours in advance unless due to health emergencies; however\, registrations can be transferred to another program in the future. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://njaudubon.org/event/fishing-basics-4/
LOCATION:G. Thomas Donch Nature Preserve (formerly known as Franklin Lakes Nature Preserve)\, 1 Nature Preserve Way\, Franklin Lakes NJ\, NJ\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adult Program,Children's Program,Family Program,Lorrimer Sanctuary,Nature Walk
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://njaudubon.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Fishing-Basics-2026.webp
GEO:40.9786864;-74.1955675
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=G. Thomas Donch Nature Preserve (formerly known as Franklin Lakes Nature Preserve) 1 Nature Preserve Way Franklin Lakes NJ NJ United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=1 Nature Preserve Way\, Franklin Lakes NJ:geo:-74.1955675,40.9786864
END:VEVENT
