UID:10012206-1785943800-1785951000@njaudubon.org
SUMMARY:Family Meadows Meander
DESCRIPTION:NEW 2026! Join CMBO staff and naturalists for this free walk at The Nature Conservancy’s Meadows property! Are you looking for a fun way to explore the outdoors with your family this summer? Join CMBO volunteers for an interactive bird walk around The Nature Conservancy’s South Cape May Meadows! Each family will start the program with a bird bingo card full of breeding birds who are calling the Meadows home this summer. As the group explores the trail\, every bird seen will get you closer to bingo! If this sounds like something your family will enjoy\, we hope to see you there! The event is free\, but pre-registration is required. \n\n\nCOST: FREE \n\n\nInterested in becoming a member? Please click on the following link to learn more or join: Become a Member today! \n\n\nIMPORTANT INFORMATION:  \nWe bird in all weather. Be sure to check the forecast in advance and dress in layers appropriate for prevailing weather conditions. The weather in Cape May can differ considerably from nearby inland areas and may be warmer\, colder\, or windier so it’s best to be over prepared. We may have to bird in the rain\, so please bring your rain gear. \n\n\nTRANSPORTATION: We may walk up to 1.5 miles\, over generally level\, sometimes muddy or sandy terrain. Some trips involve walks over jetties. \nCANCELLATION: NJ Audubon’s CMBO programs are virtually never cancelled. If we cancel\, due to lack of participation\, severe weather\, or unforeseen circumstances\, all participants will be notified as soon as possible and are eligible for a full refund. Participants may cancel without penalty if greater than 48 hours in advance. Sorry\, no refund for cancellations less than 48 hours in advance unless due to health emergencies; however\, registrations can be transferred to another program in the future. \n\n\nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://njaudubon.org/event/family-meadows-meander/2026-08-05/
LOCATION:The Nature Conservancy’s South Cape May Meadows\, 692 Sunset Blvd\, Cape May\, NJ\, 08204\, United States
CATEGORIES:Bird Walk,Birding,Cape May Bird Observatory,Cape May Bird Observatory's Northwood Center,Family Program
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://njaudubon.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Family-Meadows-Meander-.jpg
GEO:38.9380767895;-74.9446344028
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The Nature Conservancy’s South Cape May Meadows 692 Sunset Blvd Cape May NJ 08204 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=692 Sunset Blvd:geo:-74.9446344028,38.9380767895
END:VEVENT
