UID:10011225-1786183200-1786194000@njaudubon.org
SUMMARY:Recycled Silver Charm Workshop
DESCRIPTION:“Join local artisan\, MacLaren of HKM Jewelry\, on the Cape May Harbor for a pop-up jewelry workshop at The Nature Center of Cape May! \nYou will learn how to melt sterling silver bits and bobs from my past classes to create your very own customized charm – in just 3 hours! You will be able to choose your favorite stamps from a variety of options provided\, and then hammer them into your charm. Basic jewelry making tools and traditional metalsmithing techniques will be covered\, all while overlooking the beautiful Harbor of Cape May. Chain options will be for sale after class if desired. \nYour workshop ticket will include a donation to the NCCM\, helping to support its mission to educate and conserve the native ecosystem our community thrives within. No experience is necessary\, this is a skill based class and almost anyone can do it! Students must be at least 18 years of age to attend without an adult. Only 8 seats are available so sign up ASAP\, as the spots will fill fast! \n*Please bring your reading glasses to help you see tiny details if you use them\, wear sneakers or boots\, and tie back long hair for class. The minimum number of students needed to run this class is 4\, if the minimum is not met you will receive a full refund. No refunds will be given for student cancellations within 1 week prior to class\, it is your responsibility to find replacement person to fill your seat in the event that you cannot attend. \nWHERE: Nature Center of Cape May\, 1600 Delaware Avenue\, Cape May\, New Jersey. \n***Please arrive 10 minutes before class to get settled in and allow time to find parking on the street\, or in the lot. Street parking is free. This event will be held in the classroom building – on the right-hand side\, at the corner of the property.*** \nWHEN: August 8th\, 10:00am – 1:00pm \nCOST: $175 per participant \nInterested in becoming a member? Please click on the following link to learn more or join: Become a Member Today! \n\n\n\nCANCELLATION POLICY: Participants may cancel without penalty if greater than 1-week in advance. Sorry\, no refund for cancellations\, 1-week in advance unless due to health emergencies; however\, registrations can be transferred to another program in the future. Please try to gift your spot to a friend if you cannot make it after the 1-week mark\, as materials and supplies are prepared for you the week of the event. \n\nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://njaudubon.org/event/recycled-silver-charm-workshop/
LOCATION:Nature Center of Cape May\, 1600 Delaware Avenue\, Cape May\, NJ\, 08204\, United States
CATEGORIES:Nature Center of Cape May,Workshop
