SUMMARY:Summer Sundays at Lorrimer Sanctuary
DESCRIPTION:Join us each Sunday of Summer for a nature experience for people of all ages! Get ready for some great summer activities at Lorrimer Sanctuary. \nThese drop in programs are designed to be at your own pace. Great for families\, adults and kids alike! \nSCHEDULE: \n\nJune 14th: Reptile Meet and Greet\nJune 21st: Father’s Day Bird Walk (sign up here: Father’s Day Bird Walk Tickets\, Sunday\, Jun 21 from 10:30 am to 12 pm | Eventbrite)\nJune 28th: Fantastic Frogs\nJuly 5th: Rainbows and Colors\nJuly 12th: Water Pollution\nJuly 19th: What’s in the Water\nJuly 26th: BREAK WEEK\nAugust 2nd: Food Chain\nAugust 9th: Summer Nature Walk\nAugust 16th: Incredible Insects\nAugust 23rd: Garden Party\nAugust 30th: See Ya\, Summer!\n\nCOST: FREE \nREGISTER HERE \nLorrimer Sanctuary Turns 70 in 2026! Celebrate with us and make a donation to support our expansion project. DONATE TODAY
URL:https://njaudubon.org/event/summer-sundays-at-lorrimer-sanctuary/2026-08-09/
LOCATION:Lorrimer Sanctuary\, 790 Ewing Avenue\, Franklin Lakes\, NJ\, 07417\, United States
